WEBVTT

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:14.450
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.690
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.030
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:25.130
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.070
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:36.620
<i>You've Become a Little Stronger</i>

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.290
Hey, Mahiro!

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.220
Big Brother!

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.930
Let me borrow your uniform.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:50.630
Okay!

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.670
—What?!
—What?!

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.270
And then...

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:56.140
the friends she was with dragged Mahiro off and they ran away.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.540
Why wouldn't they?! lt doesn't have to be a uniform!

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.610
l just need to move about the school without arousing suspicion,

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.410
so your gym clothes will do fine.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:07.180
Oh yeah! Our jerseys are the same for the guys and the girls!

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.850
I'll think of a plan for the search by tomorrow.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.080
Right!

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.790
One week until the homunculus embryo reaches her brain.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.300
<i>One week to settle all of this!</i>

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:53.700
<i>Day One</i>

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:02.440
The physical characteristics of the Creator in the papillon mask

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:04.070
are outlined in these notes.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:07.250
From the line on the arm-band, we know the Creator is a third-year student.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.250
There are a total of six third-year classes.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.590
lf we check two classes a day, we'll be finished in three days.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.380
lt's just a matter of time.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.980
Let me know if you find a guy like that,

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:18.150
and I'll confirm it.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.420
But you don't know what his real face looks like, right?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.230
You'll know by the looks of his eyes.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.790
lt's the color of a rotten river.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.660
Master! Are you okay?

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.030
l guess it wasn't good to ride on your back

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:38.040
without considering my own physical condition.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.140
Master, it would be best if we vacate this place.

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.170
The alchemist warrior, huh?

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:47.610
Yes. l believe it's better to be safe than sorry.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.850
On the contrary.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.290
This is an important time.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.420
We should refrain from any unusual activity.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.320
And the lady warrior will transform into a homunculus

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:57.330
in one week if we just leave her be.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.890
As for the boy, there's no need to rush.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:02.160
lt'll be sufficient for the moment

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.530
as long as we don't neglect the surveillance.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.230
Keep your eyes open, understand, Kawazui?

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:07.910
Right!

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:13.610
By the way, you haven't identified the boy warrior at all?

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:18.010
Sorry, Master.
The small frogs can't see very well, so...

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.390
We just can't seem to find him.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:30.590
Of course... lt's still only been half a day since we started the search.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:33.020
That's right.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.540
What, you didn't get enough sleep?
Make sure you sleep at night!

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.360
What about you, Tokiko?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.640
Hmm?

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:41.200
Are you okay?

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:43.470
You've been holding your stomach the whole time since last night...

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.470
Oh. This?

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:49.150
l just end up holding it because it's got some weight to it!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:52.540
l see...

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.280
Don't worry about me.
Go, it's the first bell.

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:01.590
Oh shoot. Umm, next class is...

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:03.660
Oh!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.270
Oh yeah, my jersey!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.400
Mahiro!

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.370
Let me borrow your gym clothes!

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:14.800
OK!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.770
No jersey?

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.240
Where are you, Creator?!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:39.520
Buso Renkin!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:50.810
<i>Tokiko told me to make sure to sleep,</i> <i>but we only have one week.</i>

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.640
<i>By then, l need to master the lance</i>

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.810
<i>and get the Creator</i> <i>in the papillon mask!</i>

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:58.480
First, 1,000 practice swings, same as yesterday.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.380
One! Two!

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:03.190
Three! Four! Five!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.560
<i>Where's the...Creator?</i>

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:14.090
<i>Where?</i>

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.770
<i>Where?</i>

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.340
<i>Where? Where is he?!</i>

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.440
<i>Day Two</i>

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:23.200
<i>Day Three</i>

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:26.770
<i>He's not here.</i>

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:29.110
<i>He's not here! He's nowhere!</i>

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.640
Darn it!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.360
<i>Day Four</i>

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:42.760
l see. So they're looking all over the academy for me, huh?

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.560
Must be quite a struggle.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.530
And about the male warrior...

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.270
You still can't identify him, right?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.500
Since it seems the small frogs cannot see very well.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:57.010
Oh well. We've got the advantage as things stand now.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:01.910
As soon as l recover my strength,
I'll gather all my research up to now.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.520
And begin the final experiment...

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:17.220
Ohh, l'm hungry. l haven't eaten anything lately.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:22.830
l've reached my limit as is to be expected.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.270
<i>The Creator is nowhere to be found,</i>

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:31.540
<i>and my training doesn't seem</i> <i>to show any results...</i>

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.680
<i>beside the negative effects of muscle pain</i> <i>and lack of sleep from it.</i>

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.050
Don't make such pathetic noises!

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.750
l can't help it...

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.890
Let's wrap up the search at school for today.

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.890
lt seems we're doing this all the wrong way,

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.980
how we search or where we search.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.500
Anyway, we'll reset things and start over.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:51.660
That would be better.

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.730
Okay, got it.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:56.670
Hey, don't be so obviously depressed!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:57.970
But...

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.600
lt'll be okay. We still have time...

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:07.170
Besides, it's not like the time up until now was a complete waste.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.880
Since starting our search, they've been on the lookout for us

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.510
with no indication of taking any sort of action.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:13.990
ln other words,

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.080
there haven't been any victims in these four days.

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:19.060
This is the irrefutable result of our actions.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.560
Tonight, I'll think about tomorrow onward.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:26.550
lt seems you've accumulated some fatigue, so take a good rest.

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:29.060
Okay. Then, see you tomorrow.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.570
We'll get the Creator tomorrow for sure.

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.510
Tokiko sure is awesome.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.110
She doesn't call herself a warrior for nothing.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.350
l've got to try harder too.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.620
l know! I'll try asking her

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.320
what l should do to master the Buso Renkin.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:56.350
Tokiko!

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:12.300
lt'll be okay. We still have time...

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.520
<i>l've got to try harder!</i>

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.460
That girl looks tasty!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.700
l want to eat her so badly, l can't stand it.

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:47.340
The Creator may be interested in an alchemist warrior homunculus.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.720
But that doesn't make any difference to me.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.710
Besides, l wouldn't be able to eat her once she becomes a homunculus.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:55.950
Three days left until the expiration date.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.490
l've got to eat her up quick.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:01.350
But first, l guess it'll be you, eh, Muto?

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:07.770
You killed my little frogs, didn't you?
You must atone for that.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.790
With your life!

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:11.840
Bring it on!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.610
Well. You're quite brave...

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.210
l won't let you lay a finger on Tokiko!

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:21.340
I'll defeat you and make you tell about the Creator.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:26.180
Are you thinking you can beat me even though you're just a human?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:28.010
l know full well that l'm inexperienced.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.750
But l don't want to make Tokiko fight!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.420
Other than Tokiko,

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:35.050
l'm the only one in this town who can fight you guys!

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.800
How impertinent.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.990
Well, the result will be the same, though.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.740
Kazuki, are you there? l'm coming in!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:58.880
<i>He's not here, huh?</i>

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:03.020
<i>Oh well. I'll leave the gym clothes</i> <i>l borrowed.</i>

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:07.190
<i>Visualization</i>
<i>1000 practice swings</i>
<i>Running 5 km</i>
<i>Special training regimen!</i>

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:09.030
<i>So this is the reason for</i> <i>his lack of sleep, huh?</i>

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.600
<i>That's so cute.</i>

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:18.040
<i>But he can't master the Buso Renkin</i> <i>doing it this way.</i>

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:22.840
Kazuki! l got something good!
The lady-type thing you like...

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.640
Whoa! Tokiko!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.350
l see. So Kazuki likes this kind of stuff, huh?

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.880
But anyway, you need to control your perversions.

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:36.480
Aaaa, l've been upgraded from lewd to peeping tom!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.050
Oh, what's up, Tokiko?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.160
Nothing. l just came to return something l borrowed.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.830
Then I'll let him know when he comes back.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.200
He hasn't come back yet?

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.600
—l guess.
—He wasn't at dinner, either...

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:52.240
Tokiko?

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.200
—Wait a minute!
—This is the second floor!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.400
Tokiko!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.440
—What?
—Huh?

00:10:58.710 --> 00:10:59.980
She's gone!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.090
<i>That kid's doing something reckless</i> <i>by himself again...</i>

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.850
Buso Renkin!

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.300
A call, huh? Nice.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:28.940
Then, I'll do one, too.
Homunculus Change.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.680
How about it?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.950
A riverbed at night's pitch dark, isn't it?

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.380
lt's on the outskirts of town, and nobody ever comes.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:44.860
lt's the best place for eating in a leisurely manner.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:48.430
<i>lt's my first time fighting one-on-one.</i>

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.790
<i>And it's my first time going</i> <i>head-to-head like this...</i>

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.900
Come on. Your legs are shaking.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.840
l told you. l'm fully aware that l'm inexperienced.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:03.440
But l'm the only one in this town who can fight you!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.770
So I'll fight!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:12.910
You don't get it. Just adding your will to fight is not enough to fill the void

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:15.720
that separates
Humans and Homunculi.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.830
Damn!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:27.830
What? lf you can't even dodge head-on attacks,

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:29.630
l guess this is the end.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.180
How disappointing.

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:52.480
<i>No matter how much</i> <i>he may have practiced,</i>

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.050
<i>mastering the Buso Renkin</i> <i>is another story.</i>

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.860
<i>lf he fights now,</i> <i>the only thing waiting for him is death...</i>

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:03.540
l've got a treasure.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:07.200
And now if l can eat that girl,
I'll get another one.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.640
lf l bring back two pieces of kakugane as souvenirs,

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:12.110
l wonder if the Creator will let me have my way.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:18.780
But how do l revert this to kakugane?

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.420
<i>What? l'm alive...</i>

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.690
<i>Oh, that's right. My heart's empty, isn't it?</i>

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:31.660
<i>So l'm totally fine even</i> <i>with a hole in it.</i>

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:36.900
<i>No, l'm not. Sure enough,</i> <i>dying really hurts like hell...</i>

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.160
<i>Even if it hurts this much,</i>

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:42.440
<i>l bet Tokiko would endure it</i> <i>and try to hide it.</i>

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.500
<i>Mahiro will probably cry her eyes out.</i>

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:49.170
<i>l wonder how Okakura,</i>
<i>Daihama and Rokumasu would do?</i>

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.020
<i>Heck no!</i>

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.280
<i>l don't want to make...</i>

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.690
<i>anyone experience something</i> <i>this painful!</i>

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.660
Don't be taking that away without asking.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:10.730
l see. You want to experience even more fear and pain, huh?

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.170
I'll endure the fear and pain.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.270
This is the new life Tokiko gave me.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:19.600
The power that resides in this new life

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.670
is not for protecting myself.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:25.480
lt's the power to fight, and protect everyone from you guys!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:30.090
Yeah-yeah, fine. Just die already.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.790
The little frogs have been wiped out?

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.100
What's this...?

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:51.810
<i>Buso Renkin is one's own fighting instinct</i> <i>that has taken on a form.</i>

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.910
<i>During a real life battle to the death,</i>

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.250
<i>you get the feel for and</i> <i>understand the special properties.</i>

00:14:56.320 --> 00:15:00.380
<i>Training starts after that.</i>
<i>Kazuki, you don't understand.</i>

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:04.960
<i>l get it.</i>

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:07.790
<i>Tokiko's Valkryie Skirt has</i> <i>four robotic arms</i>

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.560
<i>that move quickly and precisely.</i>

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:12.130
<i>My lance has this ornamental cloth</i>

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:14.630
<i>that morphs into energy in concert</i> <i>with my will to fight.</i>

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.840
<i>This is the special property</i> <i>of my Buso Renkin!</i>

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.240
You will tell me about the Creator!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.400
Hell no!

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:27.650
A large amount of nutrients are necessary to create one small frog.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:31.040
I'll eat her! First, I'll eat that girl!

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.880
No way will l let you do that!

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:06.150
Oh, okay, l won't eat her.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:10.190
l won't eat other humans anymore.
So please don't kill me!

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.850
That's the truth, right?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.530
You promise, right?!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.400
R-Really, really. l promise, really.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:23.130
And one more thing.
The Creator in the papillon mask...

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.640
Where is he?!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:29.230
Oh, right, right.
You guys just don't follow through.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:32.440
The facilities used by the students isn't just the school building.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:37.550
Yikes. l'm sorry.
I'll just say it without acting pompous!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:41.720
Just, just please save me.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.730
What?
Oh my, my, my, my!

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.100
What's with this guy intimidating me?!

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.630
Why you jerk!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.400
Phew, l'm saved.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:59.000
No, this is the end!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.900
H-Hanabusa.

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:06.810
The Creator has long since anticipated your selfish behavior...

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.040
You unsightly frog!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.590
All those who disobey the Creator are unsightly.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:24.460
Don't move any further!

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.090
I'll kill you instantly if you move!

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:30.000
lf l don't move?

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.930
I'll let you die quickly!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:35.010
l am amazed that you found us here.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.580
l've checked out all of your feeding grounds! Buso!

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:40.280
Buso!

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.180
Stop this futile resistance.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:51.690
You'll become one of us in three days, no matter how hard you try.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:55.420
Buso Renkin!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.730
Even if l am to become a monster,

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.370
I'll kill as many more of you as l can by then.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.100
Even if l become one,

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.670
the first thing I'll do is kill the Creator in the papillon mask.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.880
Monsters like you shouldn't be underestimating an alchemist warrior!

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:17.480
Disgusting!

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:20.080
Those words! That attitude!
That expression!

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:22.520
Those who interfere with the Creator are unforgivable!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:24.120
Shut up, man-eater!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.330
This is the power the Creator gave me!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:33.030
These one hundred thorns won't let even one bug through.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:39.140
l warned you that l'd kill you quickly if you didn't move!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:46.670
I'll splatter...your guts!

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:57.650
Raising the power to heal, working upon the survival instinct.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:00.490
A power that comes with the kakugane.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.330
Tokiko, how...?

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:06.660
l told you to follow my instructions from now on, right?

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:08.970
Why did you fight alone?

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:13.810
l'm sorry. l overestimated myself.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.380
<i>l'm a bad liar.</i>

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.050
Oh well.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.110
But this is what will happen to you the next time you do things your own way.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:30.320
Hey, keep still.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.260
Your wounds are still on the mend.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.890
R-Right.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.460
Listen, Tokiko. l figured it out.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:41.530
That ornamental cloth that morphs into energy is the special property of my lance.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.330
And with that, l managed to defeat a homunculus.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:45.970
Defeat a homunculus?!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:50.740
Yeah... A disgusting frog thing.
But look what it got me.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:56.470
That's right.
You're still very inexperienced!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:01.150
Yeah... l know. l have to try much harder.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:02.750
That's right.

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:06.550
<i>But you've become</i> <i>a little stronger today.</i>

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.320
<i>Have a good rest for now in order</i> <i>to do your best again tomorrow...</i>

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.620
The Creator's homunculi up till now were all prototypes.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:19.190
His final product is the one he is forging right now.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:22.100
The Creator's true motive, is to...

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.330
Next time, "Another New Life."

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.070
I'll splatter your guts out!
